# .claude is partly tracked: .claude/specs/ holds checked-in specs. Ignore rules
# here must stay per-subdirectory — a blanket `.claude/` rule cannot be undone by
# `!.claude/specs/`, because git does not descend into an excluded directory.
.claude/solves/
.claude/worktrees/
